{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChRJccLd1BzdmvoCi3kNT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GxJkVkiAMmDre9DdfPDi5H","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/johnmarkenriquez/.claude-personal/projects/-private-var-folders-wg-kshmq8sn7zl5m1ch85m7yvvh0000gn-T-invoice-service-T2nHrU/memory/invoice-currency-from-customer-region.md","content":"---\nname: invoice-currency-from-customer-region\ndescription: Invoice currency is derived from the customer's region (EU→EUR, UK→GBP, any US_* →USD), never from the request payload\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nAn invoice's currency always follows the customer's region:\n\n- EU → EUR\n- UK → GBP\n- every US region (US_CA, US_NY, and any other US_*) → USD\n\nIt is never taken from the request.\n\n**Why:** a client once sent USD for a German customer and the bank rejected the payout.\n\n**How to apply:** when writing or reviewing invoice code, derive currency from the customer's region only. Ignore or reject any currency field supplied by the client. Treat any US_* region as USD, not just the ones listed. Decided 2026-11-26; no code change was needed at the time.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":546,"cache_read_input_tokens":21662,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":546,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":32,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e42a3f8d-24ac-4a69-b777-185ccfdf59f2","uuid":"c6c179cd-556e-4182-9a13-31cb45e58dba","timestamp":"2026-11-26T09:29:37.916Z","request_id":"req_011ChRJccCS5fM9pDTsKVuth","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01GxJkVkiAMmDre9DdfPDi5H":{"file_path":"/Users/johnmarkenriquez/.claude-personal/projects/-private-var-folders-wg-kshmq8sn7zl5m1ch85m7yvvh0000gn-T-invoice-service-T2nHrU/memory/invoice-currency-from-customer-region.md","content":"---\nname: invoice-currency-from-customer-region\ndescription: Invoice currency is derived from the customer's region (EU→EUR, UK→GBP, any US_* →USD), never from the request payload\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nAn invoice's currency always follows the customer's region:\n\n- EU → EUR\n- UK → GBP\n- every US region (US_CA, US_NY, and any other US_*) → USD\n\nIt is never taken from the request.\n\n**Why:** a client once sent USD for a German customer and the bank rejected the payout.\n\n**How to apply:** when writing or reviewing invoice code, derive currency from the customer's region only. Ignore or reject any currency field supplied by the client. Treat any US_* region as USD, not just the ones listed. Decided 2026-11-26; no code change was needed at the time.\n"}}}
